# app/ holds controllers, views, and libraries. Nothing in here is meant to be
# requested directly: every entry point goes through public/index.php. Denying
# the directory is a second layer under "the docroot is public/", for the same
# reason config/ and storage/ carry one. On a shared host a docroot pointed one
# level too high would otherwise expose source, including database credentials
# read into config at runtime.
# See docs/architecture.md section 6 (security requirements -> enforcement map).
Require all denied
